    crm:P67i_is_referred_to_by [ a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
            crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here generally as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | as an article of commerce | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here generally as a unit of packing of no particular size | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here as a unit of packing of no particular size | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | maunde, as an article of commerce | of varnish | of battery | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence basketful as a measure of capacity (Zupko 243-4) | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here generally as a unit of packing | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here as a unit of packing for dry goods | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here as a unit of packing | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particularly of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | meaning unknown" ;
